= Structures =
=== renderengine::ProgramBuffer ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Offset !! Length !! Type !! Name !! Description !! Comments
|-
| 0x0 || 0x4 || void* || m_programBuffer ||  || Set at runtime
|-
| 0x4 || 0x4 || uint32_t || m_programSize ||  || Set at runtime
|-
| 0x8 || 0x4 || uint32_t || m_programOffset ||  || Set at runtime
|-
| 0xC || 0x4 || [[#renderengine::ProgramBuffer::Type|Type]] || m_programType || Shader type || Pixel or vertex shader
|-
| 0x10 || 0x4 || uint32_t || m_programFlags || Flags || See [[#Flags|flags]]
|-
| 0x14 || 0x4 || [[#CGprogram|CGprogram]] || m_cgProgramBuffer || Shader program || 
|-
| 0x18 || 0x4 || uint32_t || m_cgProgramSize || Shader program length || 
|-
| 0x1C || 0x4 || uint32_t || m_numParameters || Number of parameters || 
|-
| 0x20 || 0x4 || [[#renderengine::shaderpatch::ParameterOffsetTable|ParameterOffsetTable]]* || m_parameterOffsetTable || Parameter offset table || nullptr if vertex shader
|}

Immediately followed by a set of [[#renderengine::ProgramBuffer::ProgramVariableDescriptor|ProgramVariableDescriptor]] entries of an amount defined by m_numParameters.

=== renderengine::ProgramBuffer::ProgramVariableDescriptor ===
Describes the parameters in the CG parameter array.

{| class="wikitable"
! Offset !! Length !! Type !! Name !! Description !! Comments
|-
| 0x0 || 0x2 || uint16_t || m_index || Resource index of the parameter || 
|-
| 0x2 || 0x2 || uint16_t || m_numConstants || Number of parts in this constant, resulting in <nowiki><constant>[n]</nowiki> || 
|-
| 0x4 || 0x2 || uint16_t || m_dataType || Data type of the parameter || Only 1 (float) is used<br>rw::graphics::Shader::DataType?
|-
| 0x6 || 0x2 || uint16_t || m_cgParamIndex || Index of the parameter in the CG parameter array || 
|}

